e her contact details?\", \"Oh and totally separate, I need to dig out the steeple paperwork before I forget where it went, can you find it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0037\", \"v\": [[\"um so what debts are there between me and Vadim Zunnett, like who owes who?\"], [\"Could you tell me what debts there are between Vadim Zunnett and me, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0038\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get my head around all the shared money stuff, so what's gone into Losness?\", \"Separate question — I can't remember where I filed them, but which group did the parts go into?\", \"And who's actually in that group? I'd like to know who I'm splitting things with.\"], [\"umm what's… what's gone into Losness?\", \"oh and uh, the parts, which group did those go in?\", \"okay and who's, um, who's in it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0039\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out who I'm splitting things with, so who is in the Losness group?\", \"Different thing — I feel like I got loads done, so which tasks did I finish today?\", \"Hmm, looking at that list, the third one should be ticked off properly, so can you mark it done?\", \"Oh and I want to show someone a few shots, so can you pull up the photos I took recently?\"], [\"Could you tell me who is in the Losness group, please?\", \"Also, which tasks did I finish today, please?\", \"Would you mind ticking off the third one?\", \"Could you show me the photos I've taken recently, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0040\", \"v\": [[\"bin every packing note\", \"undo that\", \"dinner friday — who with?\"], [\"I'm done with all the trip prep now and it's just clutter, so can you get rid of every packing note?\", \"Oh no, I didn't mean that, I still need them actually — can you bring them back?\", \"Totally different thing, I've half forgotten the plans I made, so who's my dinner on friday with?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0041\", \"v\": [[\"My camera roll is a total mess and I'm finally tidying it up, so could you delete the Svea photo?\"], [\"delete the Svea photo pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0042\", \"v\": [[\"delete close-up photo\", \"what's left on replace kemal's crayon?\", \"bin the first one\", \"birthdays or anniversaries this week?\", \"last spoke to Trannine Tehrani?\"], [\"um can you delete the, uh, the close-up photo?\", \"oh and what's left to do on the, um, replace kemal's crayon plan?\", \"okay bin the, um, the first one\", \"uh different thing, are there any birthdays or anniversaries this week?\", \"and when did I last, um, talk to Trannine Tehrani?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0043\", \"v\": [[\"um how much has been spent in the, uh, number 66 kitty group?\", \"ah actually, forget it\", \"okay so what's my, uh, earliest appointment on sunday?\", \"can you make a task to, um, send the class booking?\", \"oh and uh, everything that mentions Mura?\", \"okay and, um, what's my calendar got on that?\"], [\"I'm trying to see whether the shared pot is running low, so how much has been spent in the number 66 kitty group?\", \"Actually never mind, I'll look into that another time, forget it.\", \"Different thing, I'd love a lie-in if I can manage it, so what's my earliest appointment on sunday?\", \"Ah right, I still need to sort that out, so could you add a task to send the class booking?\", \"Separate thing, I'm trying to remember all the stuff tied to her, so can you pull up everything mentioning Mura?\", \"Out of all that I mostly care about plans, so what does my calendar have on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0044\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little album of autumn stuff, so what pictures did I take in October?\"], [\"Could you show me the pictures I took in October, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0045\", \"v\": [[\"ticked off this week?\"], [\"what did i tick off this week\"]]}","ttft_ms":32963,"type":"result","duration_ms":48036,"uuid":"0e71f360-8055-42d5-9f2e-f899373ccf96","ttft_stream_ms":1640,"time_to_request_ms":152,"first_content_frame_ms":1641,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22557811,"warm_spare_claimed":false